WEBVTT

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:09.152
her STEVEN SPIELBERG vet mir zen, nemt er mir glaykh

00:00:08.635 --> 00:00:09.557
ye

00:00:09.327 --> 00:00:10.637
vi E.T.

00:00:16.954 --> 00:00:21.403
azoy mit yenem yid er hot geshpilt in teater di shverste role

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:24.913
gefregt "vos hot ir geshpilt?" zogt er "getrogn tish un benk.

00:00:25.071 --> 00:00:27.765
s'iz zeyer shver geven."

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.929
di shverste role, yo?

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.283
er hot geshpilt di shverste role.

00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:35.510
er darf trogn a sha-

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:43.711
iz zenen mir shteyn geblibn vu ikh bin gekumen keyn Tshernovits.

00:00:43.887 --> 00:00:46.260
un ikh hob mit mayn onkl

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.827
bay im gevolt voynen, hot er

00:00:48.827 --> 00:00:50.647
tsi hot nisht gehat keyn

00:00:51.058 --> 00:00:57.059
plats, er hot nisht gevolt, ikh ve- er vil nisht. er ligt shoyn bagrobn, loz er lign in ganeydn

00:00:58.213 --> 00:00:59.084
un

00:01:00.795 --> 00:01:02.476
hot men NUR geholfn

00:01:03.259 --> 00:01:06.392
miskher tsu makhn. dos kumt shpeter

00:01:07.225 --> 00:01:11.125
er hot mir gevolt arayngebn, undz ale dray, in a kinderheym.

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:14.225
zog ikh tsum onkl, Shlomke hot er geheysn

00:01:14.987 --> 00:01:19.472
"ikh bin yetst antlofn, vi me zogt fun a, aza gehenem

00:01:19.472 --> 00:01:22.001
vilstu mikh araynleygn in a tsveytn?"

00:01:23.172 --> 00:01:27.773
un oyf di gas hob ikh getrofn kinder, genoy zolkhe vi ikh

00:01:28.437 --> 00:01:29.646
vos zenen oykh

00:01:31.542 --> 00:01:33.243
e- avek fun di

00:01:33.243 --> 00:01:36.497
fun di kinder heymen in Rusland. undz ho'mir zikh gekent

00:01:36.705 --> 00:01:42.267
zenen mir tsuzamen geforn nokh Rusland. dem hot men durkhgelozt, di andere do in DONBAS

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:47.527
hobn zey mir gezogt "s'iz do do a rebe, Sekurener rebe, heyst er, ⟨un er⟩

00:01:47.527 --> 00:01:48.968
nemt kinder

00:01:49.682 --> 00:01:51.920
vos zenen navenad

00:01:52.652 --> 00:01:56.057
oykh kinder fun kloysters un fun, fun

00:01:56.057 --> 00:01:59.109
FAMILIEN kristn UNK vos m'hot zey farshtekt

00:01:59.638 --> 00:02:04.458
un, er shikt zey keyn Rumenye oyfn veg NACH Yisroel."

00:02:04.903 --> 00:02:10.904
ikh bin gekumen tsu dem rebn mit mayn yungen bruder. er iz geven alt efsher dray yor denstmol

00:02:11.046 --> 00:02:14.600
hobn mir nor gezogt kadesh, hot er nokh, fleg er shteyn

00:02:15.855 --> 00:02:18.751
un er hot im glaykh GENOMMEN tsu zikh.

00:02:19.585 --> 00:02:20.507
"⟨ir vet⟩

00:02:20.563 --> 00:02:24.016
hot nisht vu tsu shlofn, UNK shlofn in shul oyf di benk."

00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:26.919
un arum spekulirt

00:02:28.005 --> 00:02:29.698
oyf, oyf markn.

00:02:29.698 --> 00:02:33.281
vu me farkoyft dos, yents. azoy hot men zikh gedreyt.

00:02:33.777 --> 00:02:38.799
in tsveytn, dritn tog, az ikh bin gekumen zen dem bruder, hot er shoyn gehat peyes

00:02:38.856 --> 00:02:41.097
un hot shoyn gerufn mame tate.

00:02:41.097 --> 00:02:42.810
dos hot mikh gekrenkt

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:43.878
biz haynt.

00:02:44.914 --> 00:02:47.118
un er hot, geven der

00:02:47.563 --> 00:02:49.970
hot men nebekh nisht gevust vos zey makhn

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:51.691
un

00:02:52.187 --> 00:02:57.243
m'hot yedes mol aribergeshikt kinder, un der rebe, m'hot gezen dort di

00:02:57.351 --> 00:02:58.487
az ikh bin

00:02:58.487 --> 00:02:59.724
kh'shter zey.

00:02:59.815 --> 00:03:01.243
ikh ken dos nisht

00:03:01.435 --> 00:03:02.627
hot men undz

00:03:03.223 --> 00:03:06.221
f- tsvishn di ershte shoyn aribergeshikt NACH Rumenye.

00:03:06.582 --> 00:03:08.297
di tsvey eltere brider?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.815
mitn eltern bruder.

00:03:10.193 --> 00:03:12.684
un mit a AUSREDE az

00:03:13.078 --> 00:03:17.158
undz biz ir vet kumen undz k- ⟨vet⟩ der rov kumen

00:03:17.158 --> 00:03:20.368
l- legal, azoy az m'vet zikh trefn

00:03:20.368 --> 00:03:21.020
dort.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:26.589
dervayl zenen mir gekumen k- tsurik NACH RUMANIEN, tsurik NACH Bukarest

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:32.040
nokh eyn a halb yor bin ikh vider do, afile nisht, veyniker efsher

00:03:32.569 --> 00:03:34.453
zenen mir geven shvarts

00:03:35.117 --> 00:03:36.765
vayl di rusishe

00:03:36.855 --> 00:03:39.312
hobn undz GEKANNT. undz ze'mir geven

00:03:39.893 --> 00:03:41.743
unter zeyer farvaltung

00:03:42.424 --> 00:03:45.118
un di N.K.V.D. ales iz geven

00:03:45.445 --> 00:03:48.426
a- bay undz arayn un aroys.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:49.821
hot men

00:03:49.821 --> 00:03:53.572
glaykh a transport mit kinder geshikt nokh Holand.

00:03:54.928 --> 00:03:57.369
ikh bin GEKOMMEN NACH Yugoslavye.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.503
vifl kinder zent ir demolts geven dort in

00:04:01.594 --> 00:04:04.524
geven a sakh, vifl ken ikh aykh nisht zogn.

00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:08.085
ven de- ven der rov hot aykh geshikt keyn

00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:09.334
keyn Bukarest

00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:09.721
yo

00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:13.131
SINT nor geven ir tsvey, tsi UNK geven nokh mer?

00:04:11.331 --> 00:04:14.008
neyn, geven a sa- nokh merer.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.978
ir gedenkt nokh a nomen fun emetsn?

00:04:15.617 --> 00:04:19.984
⟨⟩ geven eyner Sh- Shmuel ERLEKH, a Shmuel ⟨FRUMMER⟩

00:04:19.984 --> 00:04:22.142
Yitskhok ROSENZWEIG.

00:04:23.869 --> 00:04:27.255
s'iz geven afile a zun fun a rebn

00:04:27.447 --> 00:04:29.601
er hot geheysn Yitskhok Ayzik.

00:04:30.045 --> 00:04:34.814
in BNEI BRAK iz do a SHIKUN, heyst es SHIKUN ZICHRON YITSCHAK

00:04:34.888 --> 00:04:40.889
un der iz nebekh geharget gevorn oyf di shif oyfn veg keyn Yisroel. hobn di englender im ershosn.

00:04:41.908 --> 00:04:43.052
un

00:04:43.052 --> 00:04:45.445
yetst zent ir ongekumen keyn Bukarest?

00:04:45.013 --> 00:04:45.969
yo.

00:04:45.553 --> 00:04:48.669
vu hot ir gevoynt? vu zent ir geven dort?

00:04:47.899 --> 00:04:51.029
zenen mir, iz yene tsaytn iz

00:04:51.029 --> 00:04:53.779
ven m'hot gehert fun kinderheym

00:04:53.957 --> 00:04:57.928
hobn mir ongehoybn tsu kukn velkhe kinderheym git gut esn.

00:04:57.928 --> 00:04:59.317
dos iz geven

00:04:59.509 --> 00:05:01.109
biz HEUTIGEN TAG

00:05:01.109 --> 00:05:03.671
iz, iz geven dos ershte

00:05:04.369 --> 00:05:08.311
esn. partey, nisht partey, hot undz nisht interesirt.

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:14.414
hot men GESAGT bay di religyeze git men gut esn, zenen mir gan tsu di religyeze

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:15.652
nisht nor ikh

00:05:16.047 --> 00:05:17.694
un dort hobn mir gemuzt

00:05:18.004 --> 00:05:21.474
yidishkeyt. s'iz, s'hot men nisht gesht-

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:25.221
geshtert. s'iz geblibn ⟨WAS⟩ fun dem.

00:05:24.872 --> 00:05:26.587
s'iz geven zeyer frum.

00:05:26.172 --> 00:05:28.140
yo. s'iz a gor e-

00:05:28.281 --> 00:05:33.964
un nokh hot men undz geshikt NACH, s'iz geven a shif vos iz geforn NACH Yisroel glaykh

00:05:33.964 --> 00:05:35.396
fun RUMANIEN

00:05:35.554 --> 00:05:39.885
hobn mir undz nisht gehat keyn plats. VIELE zenen yo geforn. ikh hob nisht gehat

00:05:39.975 --> 00:05:42.044
hot men undz geshikt NACH

00:05:42.878 --> 00:05:44.208
JUGOSLAWIEN

00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:45.909
in JUGO- in ZAGREB.

00:05:45.949 --> 00:05:46.753
ober

00:05:47.603 --> 00:05:51.630
langzam, s'iz geven denstmolt JUGOSLAWIEN tsu

00:05:52.058 --> 00:05:54.408
fun di krig bombardirt. ikh ge-

00:05:54.408 --> 00:05:57.838
ken mikh ERINNERN di BRUCKE vos iz yetst iber BELGRAD

00:05:57.838 --> 00:06:00.168
iz nisht geven, geven bombardirt

00:06:00.168 --> 00:06:03.273
zenen mir mit a shif aribergeforn azoy.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.448
dos kinderheym in Bukarest vu ir zent geven

00:06:05.997 --> 00:06:06.902
yo

00:06:06.448 --> 00:06:10.963
gedenkt no- ir gedenkt nokh a nomen oder adres fun dem kinderheym?

00:06:10.165 --> 00:06:11.098
neyn.

00:06:10.963 --> 00:06:11.981
ir ge-

00:06:11.098 --> 00:06:13.652
⟨un⟩ s'iz geven UNK fun di shtot

00:06:13.422 --> 00:06:14.378
aha.

00:06:14.586 --> 00:06:18.326
ir gedenkt nokh ver es hot dos GELEITET, ver es hot dos organizirt?

00:06:18.248 --> 00:06:21.397
epes eyner a SANDER hot er geheysn, f-

00:06:21.876 --> 00:06:25.549
un dos iz geven fun rumenishe yidn organizirt?

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.438
neyn, dos iz oykh geven pleytim

00:06:28.272 --> 00:06:29.649
ober s'iz geven

00:06:29.706 --> 00:06:35.083
AUCH rumenishe yidn, un s- KANN zayn s'iz shoyn geven der JOINT hot do ETWAS gehat a

00:06:36.085 --> 00:06:37.446
a ⟨fus trit⟩

00:06:37.823 --> 00:06:39.683
un ikh veys NUR, undz ho'mir gehat

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:38.593
un

00:06:39.683 --> 00:06:42.853
a rusishn soldat a yidisher, vos er hot

00:06:43.628 --> 00:06:46.254
dezertirt fun di rusishe armey

00:06:46.682 --> 00:06:50.912
un er fleg forn mit un- mit kinder UNK mit mir, mit andere

00:06:50.912 --> 00:06:54.621
in a bekeray un onLADEN a WAGEN mit BROT

00:06:54.833 --> 00:06:57.217
vayl zey hobn gemeynt az far di rusn

00:06:57.217 --> 00:06:58.370
di rumener.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:04.429
un ⟨ALSO⟩, un dan hot men DASS oykh likvidirt. m'hot ⟨undz⟩ geshikt NACH JUGOSLAWIEN.

00:07:04.587 --> 00:07:08.951
in JUGOSLAWIEN iz shoyn gekumen andere transportn fun andere

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:11.871
pletser, fun Ungarn.

00:07:12.771 --> 00:07:14.553
ver hot dos organizirt?

00:07:14.509 --> 00:07:15.347
WAS?

00:07:14.897 --> 00:07:16.764
ver hot dos organizirt?

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.536
veys ikh nisht. di SOCHNUT varshayndlekh.

00:07:16.956 --> 00:07:17.895
UNK

00:07:18.222 --> 00:07:19.144
aha.

00:07:18.542 --> 00:07:19.464
vayl di

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:22.620
un in JUGOSLAWIEN zenen mir aroyfgan oyf a shif.

00:07:23.588 --> 00:07:25.185
di hot geheysn

00:07:25.242 --> 00:07:30.146
koydem TNUAT HAMERI. nokh hot men gegebn a nomen KNESET YISRAEL.

00:07:30.068 --> 00:07:31.243
oyfn yam.

00:07:30.777 --> 00:07:31.834
oyfn yam.

00:07:31.857 --> 00:07:34.905
undz ze'mir geforn NUR bay TAGS, un NACHTS

00:07:35.164 --> 00:07:39.362
NUR NACHTS, UND TAGS iber- in, oyf, di englender zoln nisht

00:07:39.362 --> 00:07:40.591
undz ERWISCHEN.

00:07:41.172 --> 00:07:42.988
UND KURZ VOR

00:07:43.467 --> 00:07:46.037
HAIFA hobn di englender undz

00:07:46.037 --> 00:07:49.857
ERWISCHT, iz zey hobn, mit FLUGZEUGE koydem, nokh ⟨dem⟩ KOMMEN

00:07:49.857 --> 00:07:51.048
KRIEGSSCHIFFE

00:07:51.048 --> 00:07:53.670
un m'hot gaz geshpritst

00:07:53.963 --> 00:07:56.364
un zenen aroyfgeshprungen oyf di shif.

00:07:56.364 --> 00:07:57.990
zey hobn finef man

00:07:58.182 --> 00:08:01.028
avekgeshosn. tsvishn di finef WAR der

00:08:01.185 --> 00:08:02.979
zun fun dem rebn.

00:08:02.979 --> 00:08:05.550
Y- Yitskhok Ayzik hot er geheysn

00:08:06.568 --> 00:08:08.809
a yingele, vayl er hot VIELEICHT

00:08:08.809 --> 00:08:10.612
zekhtsn, zibetsn yor.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.936
vifl mentshn zenen azoy geven oyf dem shif, ze-

00:08:13.065 --> 00:08:15.607
VIER TAUSEND FUNF HUNDERT hot men gezogt.

00:08:15.765 --> 00:08:17.463
fir toyznt finf hundert

00:08:16.778 --> 00:08:19.100
yo, un m'hot undz gesh-

00:08:19.427 --> 00:08:21.364
GENOMMEN keyn HAIFA

00:08:21.364 --> 00:08:24.925
UND S'WAR mir finf tog e- in, in di shif

00:08:24.925 --> 00:08:27.555
geprest azoy vi hering

00:08:28.337 --> 00:08:30.288
vayl dos WAR aza last shif

00:08:30.514 --> 00:08:33.360
un dan hobn zey undz ariberGENOMMEN oyf

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.031
englishe shifn

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.257
mit STACHELDRAT

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:38.560
un

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:40.549
GEFAHREN NACH ZYPERN.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:47.822
in a SOMMER lager hot dos geheysn. nokh iz gevorn ZYPERN GROSS, mit vinter lager, vayl yedes MAHL iz GEKOMMEN

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:48.986
mentshn.

00:08:48.587 --> 00:08:54.504
vi iz geven dos gefil ven di englender hobn bazetst di shif? m'hot aykh gefirt keyn HAIFA, vos hot ir ge⟨UNK⟩ demolts?

00:08:52.924 --> 00:08:55.241
zeyer, ikh bin aroys mit

00:08:55.241 --> 00:08:56.714
mayne gantse

00:08:56.957 --> 00:09:04.258
zakhn, bilder vos ikh hob gehat fun di, fun di heym, un ales iz geblibn oyf di shif. ikh bin ar- ar-

00:09:04.315 --> 00:09:08.184
aroyfgan oyf di englishe shif vos ikh hob gehat oyf mir ayngetsoygn.

00:09:08.184 --> 00:09:09.540
mer gornisht.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.492
vos ho-

00:09:11.537 --> 00:09:16.104
un keyn UNK in ZYPERN hot men undz arayngeleygt in ZELTEN.

00:09:16.363 --> 00:09:18.652
tsu fir, fin- man a ZELT

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:24.018
un m'hot gegebn esn azoy vi a GEFANGNIS. eyn zayt WAR der yam

00:09:24.345 --> 00:09:28.591
un di andere SEITE WAR di KASERNE fun di englender. undz WAREN mir in di mit.

00:09:28.783 --> 00:09:30.987
ven zent ir ongekumen in ZYPERN?

00:09:32.378 --> 00:09:34.026
zeks un VIERZIG.

00:09:35.905 --> 00:09:37.114
tsvishn zeks un f-

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.909
vayl UNK geven genoy tsen monat dort.

00:09:39.909 --> 00:09:41.669
ikh hob gedarft blaybn lenger

00:09:42.267 --> 00:09:44.269
ober di KING GEORGE

00:09:44.832 --> 00:09:47.222
der VATER fun di KONIGIN fun haynt

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.298
hot gehat GEBURTSTAG

00:09:49.354 --> 00:09:54.900
hot er gegebn fir hundert kinder unter draytsn yor zoln forn keyn Yisroel.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.616
bin ikh geven tsvishn di fir hundert.

00:09:57.792 --> 00:10:00.266
ir zent geven mitn groysn bruder?

00:09:59.935 --> 00:10:02.291
neyn, der groyser bruder iz geblibn.

00:10:02.533 --> 00:10:04.619
er iz gekumen a monat shpeter.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:08.352
⟨un⟩ di tsen monat in, in dem lager

00:10:06.887 --> 00:10:08.923
bin ikh geven mitn groysn bruder.

00:10:08.352 --> 00:10:15.195
un di tsen monat, vos hot ir getun dort in lager? vos, vos hot men, vi azoy hot me- UNK mit aykh umgegangen? vos hobn zey mit a-

00:10:10.482 --> 00:10:12.740
gornisht.,

00:10:15.122 --> 00:10:19.481
zey hobn mit undz, in, di ka- in lager hobn zey zikh nisht ⟨arum⟩gemisht, NUR

00:10:15.195 --> 00:10:16.128
UNK

00:10:19.481 --> 00:10:20.553
m'hot nisht gekent

00:10:20.553 --> 00:10:22.189
a- avekloyfn

00:10:22.189 --> 00:10:25.529
oder m'iz gegangen in yam, iz geven a ABSPERRUNG.

00:10:25.529 --> 00:10:27.859
m'hot gekent shvimen NUR biz DA.

00:10:28.555 --> 00:10:32.008
UNK vos hobn di mentshn azoy getun in lager? vos hobn zey

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:34.758
gornisht. ⟨meshuge⟩ gevorn. m'hot gemakht FUSSBALL. m'hot ge-

00:10:34.917 --> 00:10:37.442
m'hot gesh- ikh hob geshpilt FUSSBALL

00:10:37.785 --> 00:10:41.424
ikh bin geven bay di yugnt a, a gantse ⟨KANON⟩

00:10:41.869 --> 00:10:45.710
un dos ales. arumgegangen mit a por

00:10:45.767 --> 00:10:50.266
shmates, un borves un naket. geven azoy vi in dzhungl.

00:10:50.678 --> 00:10:52.248
un zey hobn aykh gezogt

00:10:52.248 --> 00:10:57.828
ir kont tsurik, e- ets vet a mol kenen keyn Yisroel kumen tsi nisht, tsi m'hot epes geredt tsu aykh

00:10:55.504 --> 00:10:58.586
dos veys ikh nisht. mir hot men gornisht gezogt.

00:10:58.963 --> 00:11:02.115
m'hot NUR gevart oyf di kvotes, vayl yede monat

00:11:02.115 --> 00:11:04.289
hobn gekent dray hundert mentshn

00:11:04.482 --> 00:11:05.741
AUSREISEN.

00:11:06.608 --> 00:11:09.082
un az, ven ikh darf vartn

00:11:09.848 --> 00:11:13.082
oyf di dray hundert, volt ikh gedarft blaybn dort dray yor.

00:11:14.792 --> 00:11:16.726
azoy ikh bin geforn mit di

00:11:17.205 --> 00:11:19.202
kinder unter draytsn yor.

00:11:19.202 --> 00:11:22.464
hot men undz gebrengt in Yi- in Yisroel in a lager

00:11:22.842 --> 00:11:26.278
UNK nokh geven England, nokh nisht geven Yisroel

00:11:27.972 --> 00:11:29.513
vu hot men aykh gebrakht?

00:11:28.022 --> 00:11:29.180
nu hot men undz

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.125
vos?

00:11:29.513 --> 00:11:31.898
vu ahin iz geven vu m'hot aykh gebrakht?

00:11:31.802 --> 00:11:37.466
dos ershte iz geven di STADT ATLIT. dort iz geven aza zaml lager BEVOR

00:11:37.472 --> 00:11:39.541
un fun dort hot men ersht

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.533
geshikt vayter.

00:11:41.961 --> 00:11:43.578
⟨zenen mir gan⟩ in KIBUTSIM

00:11:43.578 --> 00:11:45.043
vu hobn mir gekent geyn?

00:11:45.505 --> 00:11:47.608
zent ir vu ahin gegangen?

00:11:47.698 --> 00:11:51.674
in a KI- in a KIBUTS vos iz nokh geven

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.421
eyder zey geyen aroys oyf zeyer

00:11:55.444 --> 00:11:56.450
BODEN

00:11:56.592 --> 00:11:58.141
zenen mir undz geven

00:11:58.141 --> 00:12:00.500
alts yugnt dort. m'hot gangen

00:12:00.507 --> 00:12:05.217
a halbn tog hobn mir gelernt, a halbn tog hobn mir gearbet, oykh a religyezer KIBUTS.

00:12:05.217 --> 00:12:07.047
s'hot geheysn YESODOT.

00:12:07.695 --> 00:12:10.304
haynt iz dos a dorf, a MOSHAV

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:12.447
un dan hot

00:12:12.522 --> 00:12:14.288
ho- iz gevorn

00:12:15.627 --> 00:12:17.831
UM ACHTUNVIERZIG

00:12:18.478 --> 00:12:19.721
Yisroel

00:12:19.997 --> 00:12:21.695
glaykh ongehoybn krig.

00:12:22.174 --> 00:12:23.940
glaykh hot men bashosn

00:12:24.655 --> 00:12:27.383
un m'hot bashosn undzer KIBUTS

00:12:27.422 --> 00:12:28.715
UNK

00:12:28.924 --> 00:12:31.734
di barakn zenen geven mit di ale zakhn

00:12:31.734 --> 00:12:34.484
iz ales farbrent gevorn. ikh bin geven oyfn feld

00:12:34.484 --> 00:12:35.837
bin ikh vider a mol

00:12:36.096 --> 00:12:37.147
geblibn

00:12:37.147 --> 00:12:38.671
NUR mit mayne

00:12:38.931 --> 00:12:42.519
zakhn oyf mir. s'hot ales farbrent. ikh hob gornisht gehat.

00:12:42.711 --> 00:12:44.038
nokh hot ongehoybn

00:12:44.095 --> 00:12:45.945
dos mit militer

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.504
zenen zikh ale tselofn in militer.

00:12:48.504 --> 00:12:54.027
un NACHn militer iz keyner mer nit tsurikgekumen in ⟨di⟩ KIBUTS. yeder iz zikh tsekrokhn.

00:12:54.203 --> 00:12:56.579
ven ir zent geven in dem KIBUTS

00:12:56.579 --> 00:12:57.639
hot ir

00:12:57.645 --> 00:13:02.414
gehat kontakt mit di mume in Rusland, in Rumenye, tsi

00:13:00.109 --> 00:13:01.166
neyn.

00:13:01.375 --> 00:13:04.274
key- neyn. nisht gehat kontakt, vayl

00:13:04.274 --> 00:13:07.696
s'iz shoyn geven ABGESCHNITTEN. ikh'hob, fleg NUR bakumen

00:13:08.192 --> 00:13:09.941
ALSO NACHTRICHTEN.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.332
der groyser bruder iz mit aykh geven?

00:13:13.272 --> 00:13:13.806
i-

00:13:13.963 --> 00:13:19.203
nisht mit mir tsuzamen. ikh bin gekumen a monat friert, bin ikh, hot mir geshikt ahin.

00:13:19.203 --> 00:13:21.063
er iz gekumen a monat shpeter

00:13:21.388 --> 00:13:28.182
un ikh hob eyn mol gevolt im bazukhn, iz shoyn geven geferlekh, vayl m'ho- m'hot nisht gekent farbayforn di arabishe derfer

00:13:28.645 --> 00:13:30.208
iz shoyn geven krig.

00:13:32.323 --> 00:13:36.434
azoy, er iz gegangen in militer far mir, vayl er iz elter fun mir

00:13:36.559 --> 00:13:39.067
azoy undz ze'mir nisht geven tsuzamen

00:13:39.242 --> 00:13:40.454
eyn TAG.

00:13:40.454 --> 00:13:43.658
NUR ⟨aza⟩ bazukh, ⟨hob ikh⟩ gevoynt ober nit tsuzamen.

00:13:44.119 --> 00:13:46.576
un vi lang zent ir geven in militer?

00:13:47.427 --> 00:13:48.990
tsvey yor denst-

00:13:51.308 --> 00:13:52.432
ts- tsi merer

00:13:52.793 --> 00:13:55.875
UNK geven ⟨in⟩ KIBUTS iz oykh geven militer.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.857
un vos iz gevorn mitn dritn bruder demolts?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:03.064
un der iz, hob ikh nokh dem gehert

00:14:03.222 --> 00:14:05.410
az zey zenen fun Tshernovits

00:14:06.259 --> 00:14:08.379
NACH Bukarest gekumen

00:14:08.571 --> 00:14:11.029
un ikh fleg bakumen ⟨ALSO⟩

00:14:11.592 --> 00:14:14.201
gants veynik NACHTRICHTEN fun

00:14:14.258 --> 00:14:17.188
LEUTE vos zenen avek, oder ikh veys vi azoy

00:14:18.578 --> 00:14:22.655
un nokh hob ikh gehert az m'hot im EINGESPERRT fun, s'iz geven

00:14:22.847 --> 00:14:25.119
ale tsienistishe

00:14:25.362 --> 00:14:30.098
makhers hot men in Rumenye EINGESPERRT in, in GEFANGNIS, un im oykh.

00:14:31.572 --> 00:14:32.831
in a tog

00:14:33.023 --> 00:14:37.640
ze ikh a- in a tsaytung, dos iz di tsaytung fun di religyeze

00:14:37.917 --> 00:14:42.737
az DAG HAMMARSKJOLD, der UNRRA SEKRETAR UNK, ⟨DEN⟩

00:14:43.165 --> 00:14:44.171
hot zikh

00:14:45.139 --> 00:14:47.971
arayngemisht. er hot aroysgenumen dem rebn

00:14:47.971 --> 00:14:49.791
fun GEFANGNIS

00:14:51.535 --> 00:14:57.688
un er iz ongekumen NACH BELGIEN oyfn veg NACH Amerike. azoy WAR geshribn.

00:14:58.386 --> 00:15:02.784
bin ikh gelofn vi a meshugener tsu di REDAKTION. kh'hob gevolt

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:07.138
visn tsi mayn bruder iz oykh mit di, in, in di familye.

00:15:07.819 --> 00:15:12.689
un mit UNK tsu telefonirn in yene tsaytn iz geven zeyer shver. kh'hob

00:15:12.689 --> 00:15:14.049
JEMANDEN dort

00:15:14.299 --> 00:15:19.608
in telefon getrofn, hot er mir gezogt mayn bruder Hershl iz oykh d- ⟨vest krign⟩ a

00:15:20.458 --> 00:15:21.650
a briv

00:15:22.028 --> 00:15:27.506
un azoy hot er ongehoybn tsu shikn mir briv, un nokh hot er geshikt a bild. ikh hob nisht gevust vi er zet oys

00:15:27.951 --> 00:15:28.839
un

00:15:29.048 --> 00:15:33.446
in ershtn peysekh, in a peysekh WAR dos, ikh gedenk nisht voser yor

00:15:33.452 --> 00:15:36.267
zenen zey gekumen oyf peysekh keyn Yisroel.

00:15:36.267 --> 00:15:38.964
s'iz geven a groyse simkhe, un

00:15:39.055 --> 00:15:40.702
in FLU- in

00:15:41.181 --> 00:15:44.381
in FLUGHAFEN, s'iz geven toyznter khasidim.

00:15:44.387 --> 00:15:47.570
undz ze'mir geven di kinder vos zenen mir geven baym rov

00:15:47.678 --> 00:15:49.188
di eyntsike on

00:15:49.188 --> 00:15:50.738
BARTE un peyes

00:15:50.738 --> 00:15:54.558
un undz ze'mir geven di, di g- mekhutonim. ikh perzenlekh

00:15:55.002 --> 00:15:59.265
nokh hob ikh gezen mayn bruder, azoy vi ikh hob aykh getsaygt a b- oyfn bild

00:16:00.132 --> 00:16:02.758
a, a yingl mit a bord. ikh hob im

00:16:03.625 --> 00:16:08.226
gelozt als a, a pitsl kind mit dray yorn. oyf eyn mol ze ikh

00:16:08.721 --> 00:16:11.415
a yingl mit a bord mit peyes.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.372
er iz geblibn bay dem rebn?

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:15.499
baym rebn, un hot oyfgevaksn azoy.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.579
un

00:16:16.939 --> 00:16:19.734
der rebe hot im oyfgenumen als kind?

00:16:20.263 --> 00:16:21.320
yetst

00:16:21.681 --> 00:16:26.082
ot dos hob ikh fargesn tsu zogn. shoyn ven undz ze'mir geven in Bukarest

00:16:26.082 --> 00:16:28.660
iz der rebe oykh shoyn geven in Bukarest

00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:31.685
un ikh hob UNK im tsvey mol ENTFUHRT.

00:16:31.685 --> 00:16:35.141
kh'hob im avekGENOMMEN mit nokh a por ⟨yunge⟩ kinder

00:16:35.164 --> 00:16:36.879
tsu undz in kinder heym

00:16:37.695 --> 00:16:42.054
ober in kinder heym hob ikh nisht gehat keyn makht. ⟨ikh bin oykh⟩ geven kleyn, hot men undz

00:16:42.054 --> 00:16:44.423
farmakht, un m'hot im tsurikgebrengt.

00:16:44.513 --> 00:16:47.882
nokh a monat tsvey hob ikh im nokh a mol avekgenumen.

00:16:48.124 --> 00:16:50.736
ikh hob nisht gekent dos farTRAGEN

00:16:50.736 --> 00:16:52.252
biz hayntikn tog.

00:16:53.085 --> 00:16:54.986
az er iz bay dem rebn?

00:16:53.102 --> 00:16:53.973
az

00:16:54.283 --> 00:16:57.044
az er i- iz bay fremde.

00:16:55.785 --> 00:16:57.028
un nisht

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:01.179
un der rebe hot im adoptirt?

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:04.486
yo, hot im ales zeyer gut, yo, d-

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.271
ho-

00:17:04.594 --> 00:17:07.575
ober dos hot mikh PERSONLICH

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:12.637
un der rebe hot im, ot, ot dem nomen fun dem rebn hot er?

00:17:11.766 --> 00:17:15.827
ot dem nomen funem rebn. er heyst Hershl Portugal

00:17:15.968 --> 00:17:17.430
un nisht Leder.

00:17:18.194 --> 00:17:23.301
un nokh iz er geven in Yisroel a tsvey vokhn, fleg mikh trefn mit im yedn tog

00:17:23.545 --> 00:17:25.766
nokh UNK zenen zey geforn keyn Amerike.

00:17:26.295 --> 00:17:28.533
fun Amerike fleg ikh hobn kontakt

00:17:29.333 --> 00:17:32.111
a briv oder telefon

00:17:33.906 --> 00:17:35.418
UND

00:17:39.801 --> 00:17:44.194
azoy oyf eyn mol shraybt, shikt er mir a briv, er iz ge- er hot khasene.

00:17:44.503 --> 00:17:49.579
dernokh hot er khasene gehat, un, un nokh hob ikh gehert yedes mol a- az s'iz do a kind.

00:17:49.579 --> 00:17:51.601
er hot gehat akht kinder.

00:17:52.249 --> 00:17:54.639
in nayntsn finef un akhtsik

00:17:55.185 --> 00:17:58.160
bin ikh geforn mit mayn gantse familye

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.583
keyn Amerike.

00:17:59.607 --> 00:18:01.238
ikh hob im BESUCHT.

00:18:02.644 --> 00:18:03.482
un

00:18:03.741 --> 00:18:07.667
di familye zayne, di froy un di groyse kinder shoyn

00:18:07.707 --> 00:18:10.941
hobn gevolt visn di STORY f-

00:18:11.217 --> 00:18:15.632
fun mayn bruder, vayl er hot nisht gevust. er hot nokh nisht gezogt.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:21.521
ober er hot shoyn o- er hot nisht fargesn z- vern er iz kleyn geven az UNK bruder.

00:18:21.493 --> 00:18:24.738
er, endlekh efsher nisht, vayl dos hob ikh

00:18:24.738 --> 00:18:25.566
IMMER

00:18:25.566 --> 00:18:29.368
ven ikh hob gehat tsayt, ven ikh WAR UNK dos arayngeredt

00:18:29.998 --> 00:18:34.160
ober nokh dem, di zibetsn yor vos ikh hob im nisht gezen, dos iz

00:18:34.318 --> 00:18:36.101
iz groys gevorn

00:18:36.748 --> 00:18:38.581
er hot yo gevust

00:18:38.942 --> 00:18:42.226
vayl ven er hot khasene gehat, hot er gegebn di kinder

00:18:42.233 --> 00:18:45.416
NAHME nokh mayn tate un nokh di mame.

00:18:45.827 --> 00:18:47.559
dos hot er yo gemakht.

00:18:48.139 --> 00:18:51.187
fun vu er hot gevust veys ikh oykh nisht.

00:18:52.864 --> 00:18:57.633
vi iz yetst aykh gegangen in Yisroel? vos hot ir getun in Yisroel?

00:18:56.779 --> 00:18:59.506
gearbet oyf a traktor. ikh bin geven a

00:19:00.508 --> 00:19:03.067
in a oranzhn PLANTATIE

00:19:03.664 --> 00:19:05.058
nokhn militer.

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:09.598
oykh geven aleyn, on keynem nisht un nisht

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.674
nisht gelekt keyn honik

00:19:12.085 --> 00:19:14.019
nokh hob ikh bakumen gelt

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.732
bin ikh aroysgeforn. ikh hob GENOMMEN

00:19:17.805 --> 00:19:23.621
dakht zikh dray oder fir monat urloyb OHNE BEZAHLUNG, ⟨zenen mir⟩ aroysgeforn NACH Eyrope.

00:19:24.387 --> 00:19:26.375
un azoy iz gevorn f-

00:19:26.375 --> 00:19:28.518
fun fir monat iz gevorn

00:19:28.518 --> 00:19:30.219
iber draysik yor.

00:19:32.065 --> 00:19:34.708
⟨ets zent⟩ nisht mer tsurikgeforn keyn Yisroel?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.360
BESUCH yo, ober

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.555
tsu blaybn

00:19:39.017 --> 00:19:43.145
nisht. ikh bin geforn keyn Yisroel. nokh dem hob ikh geheyrat in Yisroel.

00:19:43.388 --> 00:19:44.934
ven hot ir khasene gehat?

00:19:44.738 --> 00:19:46.386
in nayntsn zibetsik.

00:19:47.995 --> 00:19:51.617
in nayntsn eyn un zibetsik iz geboyrn mayn ershter zun

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:54.320
bin ikh oykh geforn keyn Yisroel, vayl mayn froy

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:59.092
hot gevolt dem ershtn SOHN, di eltern ire, er zol geboyrn in Yisroel.

00:20:01.933 --> 00:20:03.440
zent ir gekumen

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.729
keyn DEUTSCHLAND?

00:20:04.718 --> 00:20:05.657
yo.

00:20:05.207 --> 00:20:07.361
ven zent ir ongekumen keyn DEUTSCHLAND?

00:20:07.013 --> 00:20:10.247
in VIERTn februar, DREIUNDSECHZIG

00:20:10.995 --> 00:20:12.271
NACH Minkhn.

00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:16.474
UNK gearbet in Minkhn

00:20:16.564 --> 00:20:21.890
in B.M.W., un nokh hot men mir gezogt "vos broykhstu in a fabrik? kum arbet in a

00:20:22.403 --> 00:20:23.865
a lokal."

00:20:24.192 --> 00:20:28.168
bin ikh gegangen NACH KITZINGEN AM MAIN. dos iz bay WURZBURG.

00:20:28.292 --> 00:20:31.053
dort hob ikh gearbet FAST ZEHN JAHR

00:20:31.397 --> 00:20:34.614
nokh hot men mikh GENOMMEN in a shtot ANSBACH

00:20:35.498 --> 00:20:37.604
un fun dort bin ikh nokh

00:20:37.604 --> 00:20:41.567
a yor bin ikh gevorn zelbst shtendik. di balebos hot mir gegebn

00:20:41.927 --> 00:20:43.721
dos gesheft, ⟨bin⟩ ikh

00:20:43.721 --> 00:20:45.870
geven dort aleyn zelbst shtendik.

00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:48.519
un vi lang di amerikaner zenen geven

00:20:48.576 --> 00:20:51.877
iz geven parnose. di amerikaner zenen avekgegangen

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:56.146
hob ikh NUR gelt farloyrn. ikh hob nokh gelozt, m'hot mikh in gantsn dort

00:20:57.604 --> 00:21:02.722
in ANSBACH zent ir tsufelik geven. iz dort geven epes yidn? tsi lebn dortn yidn?

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:03.301
keyner nisht, neyn.

00:21:04.422 --> 00:21:06.610
ir hot mit a mol dertseylt fun a shul.

00:21:06.666 --> 00:21:10.130
s'iz DA a zeyer sheyne shul. di iz geborn gevorn

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:13.359
kh'hob aykh getsaygt, ikh ken aykh tsaygn dos bild fun di shul.

00:21:13.737 --> 00:21:15.165
ir hot dos gezen?

00:21:15.643 --> 00:21:19.434
dos iz geborn gevorn in zibetsn hundert zeks un fuftsik.

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.484
un di shul iz geblibn vayl

00:21:23.727 --> 00:21:31.753
di iz in STADT MITTE, un di hot men nisht farbrent, vayl se volt di gantse STADT gegangen, di gantse STRASSE

00:21:32.468 --> 00:21:38.115
nor ICH hob gehat a shlisl tsu, anfang, ven s'WAREN amerikaner statsyonirt in ANSBACH

00:21:38.627 --> 00:21:40.325
WAR di shul nokh

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.080
in bavegung.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.941
zenen gekumen mentshn.

00:21:42.441 --> 00:21:44.713
yo. der, vayl der

00:21:44.905 --> 00:21:49.961
rabiner fun di armey in DEUTSCHLAND hot GEWOHNT in ANSBACH

00:21:51.503 --> 00:21:53.640
un er hot organizirt

00:21:54.608 --> 00:21:57.136
un nokh dem ven der iz avekgegangen

00:21:57.136 --> 00:21:58.483
iz gevorn

00:21:58.607 --> 00:22:00.131
fleg a MAHL

00:22:00.131 --> 00:22:03.664
in NEUNtn november in di kristal nakht flegn KOMMEN

00:22:04.885 --> 00:22:08.321
tsuzamen zey a MAHL andere TAGE, ober

00:22:09.238 --> 00:22:13.248
yetst iz layder keyn, s'iz oykh do a BET hakvores dort do

00:22:13.423 --> 00:22:17.824
vos di shteyner zenen yetst do, ober di shteyner z- hot men mir gezogt

00:22:17.824 --> 00:22:20.369
lign nisht oyf dem zelbn plats

00:22:20.528 --> 00:22:21.382
vi

00:22:21.912 --> 00:22:22.938
vi z-

00:22:22.938 --> 00:22:27.541
genoy vi der TODTER iz, vayl di shteyner WAREN ale in UNK

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:30.090
un NACH di krig hot men zey

00:22:30.163 --> 00:22:31.777
tsurik UNK NAHMEN.

00:22:33.387 --> 00:22:36.800
ven ir klert azoy tsurik in di tsayt fun

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:38.105
fun di krig

00:22:39.512 --> 00:22:41.362
vos volt ir gezogt

00:22:41.554 --> 00:22:45.466
far, vi azoy hot ir ibergelebt, oder vos iz geven

00:22:45.466 --> 00:22:49.057
dos goyrl ayers vos ir zogt dos iz geven?

00:22:50.802 --> 00:22:52.669
der goyrl iz geven

00:22:54.177 --> 00:22:56.224
SEHR ales

00:22:56.224 --> 00:22:57.295
a goyrl

00:22:57.295 --> 00:23:00.532
kh'hob gekent zayn ahin, kh'hob gekent zayn aher.

00:23:01.618 --> 00:23:02.897
ven, ven

00:23:02.897 --> 00:23:04.430
se kumt nisht

00:23:05.095 --> 00:23:10.286
efsher nit a m- a monat nokh dem vos di mame tate iz geshtorbn oyf eyn mol

00:23:10.326 --> 00:23:13.104
voltn mir oykh geven geshtorbn, ale dray

00:23:15.135 --> 00:23:16.659
un dos iz geven

00:23:16.659 --> 00:23:21.423
di rusn zenen arayngekumen, un m'hot ongehoybn ts- tsu lokern azoy.

00:23:22.341 --> 00:23:25.372
azoy hob i- zenen mir a- geblibn lebn

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:29.034
vayl undz ze'mir geven dray kleyne kinder, un ikh bin zikher

00:23:29.732 --> 00:23:32.004
nokh dem vos di eltern zenen geshtorbn

00:23:32.601 --> 00:23:34.130
in tsvey vokhn

00:23:34.491 --> 00:23:36.105
dos iz a shok.

00:23:36.482 --> 00:23:40.036
zey WAREN ale in shok, volt men nisht UBERLEBT aleyn.

00:23:41.983 --> 00:23:45.554
ir klert nokh a sakh mol di tsayt tsurik?

00:23:45.358 --> 00:23:50.144
ikh kler tsurik ⟨az ikh⟩ az se tut mir vey, ikh hob nisht keyn bilder

00:23:50.438 --> 00:23:55.134
fun keyn mame. fun tatn hob ikh a bild getrofn ergets WO

00:23:55.134 --> 00:23:57.688
vos er iz nokh dakht zikh far di khasene.

00:23:58.183 --> 00:23:59.864
azoy, es iz shoyn a

00:23:59.955 --> 00:24:03.560
a lange tsayt, ikh bin oyser mishpokhe. ikh hob nisht ge-

00:24:03.634 --> 00:24:07.323
geven navenad. ikh hob oyfgevaksn in yede shtot, azoy

00:24:08.258 --> 00:24:09.520
ikh ken nisht k-

00:24:09.520 --> 00:24:11.711
⟨kumen⟩ ven ikh hob khasene gehat

00:24:12.021 --> 00:24:13.263
zenen geven

00:24:14.113 --> 00:24:18.950
VIELE mentshn. ikh hob efsher gekent tsvantsik biz draysik.

00:24:19.092 --> 00:24:20.672
un VERWANDTE

00:24:20.914 --> 00:24:22.950
hob ikh nisht FAST gekent

00:24:24.610 --> 00:24:28.823
vayl ikh hob nisht oyfgevaksn tsvishn zey. ikh WAR do un dort un dort.

00:24:29.031 --> 00:24:29.939
ikh hob

00:24:29.939 --> 00:24:32.720
a shule ⟨VOM⟩ lebn, nisht a

00:24:32.997 --> 00:24:37.243
keyn te- ikh hob nisht keyn TEORIE. ikh hob PRAXIS.

00:24:37.958 --> 00:24:39.684
dos gantse lebn mayns

00:24:39.684 --> 00:24:41.237
iz a PRAKTIKUM

00:24:41.237 --> 00:24:42.173
nisht keyn

00:24:42.173 --> 00:24:43.216
TEORIE.

00:24:45.568 --> 00:24:47.587
s'iz nokh epes do

00:24:47.695 --> 00:24:48.583
vos

00:24:49.264 --> 00:24:53.325
s'iz far aykh azoy vikhtik az ir volt dos yetst nokh gevolt zogn

00:24:54.343 --> 00:24:56.733
yetst tsu dem, di gantse zakh?

00:24:56.419 --> 00:24:57.234
ikh

00:24:57.234 --> 00:24:58.860
volt gevolt a mol

00:24:59.305 --> 00:25:00.531
BESUCHEN

00:25:01.482 --> 00:25:03.973
di keyver oves fun mayne eltern

00:25:06.325 --> 00:25:08.465
hob ikh moyre tsu forn keyn

00:25:08.465 --> 00:25:11.482
oyb se ekzistirt nokh iz a tsveyte zakh

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:13.342
un a

00:25:13.342 --> 00:25:16.359
keyn NEW YORK vil ikh forn zen vu mayn

00:25:17.023 --> 00:25:19.666
bruder GOTTSELIG iz BEGRABEN

00:25:20.820 --> 00:25:23.936
un azoy v- volt geven interesant

00:25:24.195 --> 00:25:25.505
tsu makhn

00:25:25.647 --> 00:25:32.323
aza rayze durkh di gantse fargangenheyt vu ikh hob a mol geven. volt mir geven dos a

00:25:32.498 --> 00:25:35.225
ober darf men zikh kenen LEISTEN.

00:25:35.586 --> 00:25:36.913
ober ikh volt shoyn

00:25:37.611 --> 00:25:39.244
gevolt durkh-

00:25:39.244 --> 00:25:41.334
-geyn nokh a mol di historye.

00:25:42.302 --> 00:25:45.029
dos iz volt, iz geven mayn tsil

00:25:45.070 --> 00:25:47.303
dos denk ikh a sakh mol.

00:25:47.303 --> 00:25:49.637
ersht tsu zen di keyver oves

00:25:50.014 --> 00:25:52.218
un dos iz shoyn in di zelbe

00:25:53.845 --> 00:25:54.986
FAHRT

00:25:55.245 --> 00:25:57.196
vu ikh bin geven, volt ikh

00:25:57.203 --> 00:25:58.952
gevolt zen dos oykh

00:25:58.975 --> 00:26:01.601
NACH Amerike iz shoyn LEICHTER.

00:26:01.827 --> 00:26:04.133
az ikh vel nokh a mol forn, vil ikh zen

00:26:05.640 --> 00:26:08.266
v- vayl ⟨mir⟩ hobn mit mir ongerufn

00:26:08.357 --> 00:26:10.376
az mayn bruder iz geshtorbn

00:26:10.888 --> 00:26:12.654
nokh tsvey vokhn

00:26:14.061 --> 00:26:17.379
un ikh hob mikh gevundert vos m'hot mir nisht GESAGT glaykh

00:26:18.820 --> 00:26:21.868
hobn zey gezogt shlekhte bsures

00:26:21.891 --> 00:26:23.336
zogt men nisht.

00:26:23.781 --> 00:26:26.646
ober di WAHRHEIT hob ikh ersht nokh dem

00:26:26.646 --> 00:26:27.808
ERFAHREN

00:26:27.882 --> 00:26:31.538
vayl baym shteyn leygn o- bay ⟨di m-⟩ matseyve

00:26:31.915 --> 00:26:35.537
hot men gedarft shraybn dem RICHTIGEN nomen fun tate

00:26:35.863 --> 00:26:38.320
un dos hobn zey gevolt fun mir visn.

00:26:40.268 --> 00:26:42.371
me ken nisht shraybn az er iz

00:26:42.748 --> 00:26:46.424
Hershl ben Zusye Portugal, az er iz

00:26:46.424 --> 00:26:48.159
Hershl ben Moyshe Leyb.

00:26:51.692 --> 00:26:53.474
un dos iz geven

00:26:55.168 --> 00:26:56.360
der GRUND.

00:26:57.784 --> 00:27:01.181
un far vos er iz geshtorbn, kh'hob aykh a mol shoyn gezogt

00:27:01.181 --> 00:27:03.262
ikh fil mikh BETROFFEN

00:27:04.720 --> 00:27:05.692
vayl

00:27:07.082 --> 00:27:09.793
ven undz ze'mir geven in Amerike, hobn di

00:27:10.204 --> 00:27:15.103
froy zayne un di kinder mikh gedrengt, zey viln hern di historye f-

00:27:15.103 --> 00:27:16.053
fun zayn

00:27:16.414 --> 00:27:18.844
hob ikh mikh avekgezetst baym tish

00:27:18.844 --> 00:27:23.844
ikh fun eyn zayt tish, er in di andere, un ikh hob ongehoybn tsu redn fun MAGEN aroys.

00:27:23.873 --> 00:27:25.706
GEREDET un geveynt

00:27:26.556 --> 00:27:28.440
un im hot dos VIELEICHT

00:27:29.442 --> 00:27:30.955
a bisl barirt

00:27:31.011 --> 00:27:34.020
vayl a yor shpeter iz er geshtorbn, un

00:27:34.020 --> 00:27:36.743
un ikh fil a VERANTWORTLICH.

00:27:36.765 --> 00:27:39.285
me zogt s'iz nisht oyf dir

00:27:39.285 --> 00:27:40.876
vayl epes ANDERS

00:27:41.085 --> 00:27:43.121
un mir iz dos arayn in

00:27:43.617 --> 00:27:45.383
az ikh hob im VIELEICHT

00:27:45.996 --> 00:27:48.774
zayne shmertsn UNK.

00:27:50.181 --> 00:27:54.343
ikh hob geredt un geveynt, un zey zenen geshtanen ale di gantse

00:27:54.450 --> 00:27:56.638
akht kinder. m'hot mir gekukt in moyl.

00:27:59.968 --> 00:28:02.291
her Leder, a sheynem dank

00:28:02.820 --> 00:28:06.087
vos ir hot zikh UNK geshtelt tsu dem intervyu.

00:28:05.217 --> 00:28:08.316
UNK vifl ikh hob gekent, hob ikh gezogt.

00:28:08.963 --> 00:28:12.281
un ikh vil mir zeyer badanken bar aykh

00:28:13.030 --> 00:28:14.424
un

00:28:15.561 --> 00:28:17.225
ikh vintsh aykh ales guts.

00:28:17.569 --> 00:28:19.065
nokh ken ikh zogn

00:28:19.071 --> 00:28:21.731
ven ikh vel hobn di meglekhkeyt a mol

00:28:21.957 --> 00:28:25.444
MEINE fargangenheyt durkhtsuforn

00:28:25.500 --> 00:28:28.143
dos volt geven nokh mayn tsil eyder a

00:28:28.487 --> 00:28:30.388
ober dos darf men hobn

00:28:30.647 --> 00:28:31.943
mit vemen

00:28:31.943 --> 00:28:35.383
un MOGLICHKEITEN in di lender SO WIE ikh hob arum

00:28:35.490 --> 00:28:37.171
iz nisht azoy

00:28:38.157 --> 00:28:41.914
EINFACH. me fort haynt NACH Rusland, NACH Ukrayne

00:28:42.088 --> 00:28:46.571
un dos volt ikh nokh gevolt zen, tsi s'ekzistirt nokh di keyver

00:28:48.923 --> 00:28:50.894
bikhlal di gantse

00:28:50.894 --> 00:28:53.017
vu ikh hob mir navenad geven.

00:28:52.635 --> 00:28:57.323
un ikh vintsh aykh ir zolt dos konen nokh derlebn nokh dos konen makhn. a sheynem dank.

00:28:56.348 --> 00:28:57.624
DANKE SCHON

00:28:59.942 --> 00:29:00.732
fertik?
